  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">For Fundacion Ideas Para La Pas Lesson sharing on</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lesson-sharing project on social dialogue as part of the programme for reform and plans for &#x2018;total peace&#x2019; in Colombia. This project thus provides an opportunity to constructively engage with and demonstrate support for the Government&#x2019;s plans to use dialogue to bring peace and development to Colombia. 
The project&#x2019;s activities will include: support to the partner in the design of a Citizens&#x2019; Assembly; support to a thematic dialogue on drugs and drugs trafficking; and a visit to Ireland to learn about our experience in social dialogue and the Citizens Assembly.</narrative>
  </description>
